        <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;vertical-align:top;">
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin-bottom:6px;">AWS security groups are stateful, so response traffic for an allowed flow is automatically allowed.</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;"><strong>Your Answer:</strong> <span style="color:#059669">True</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;"><strong>Correct Answer:</strong> <span style="color:#059669">True</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;background:#eff6ff;border-left:3px solid #4f46e5;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;color:#1e3a8a;margin-top:6px;"><strong>💡 Explanation:</strong> Connection tracking permits return traffic regardless of an explicit reverse-direction rule.</div>
