          <div style="font-size:12px;background:#eff6ff;border-left:3px solid #4f46e5;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;color:#1e3a8a;margin-top:6px;"><strong>💡 Explanation:</strong> Restrict the source and prefer managed access such as Systems Manager Session Manager or a controlled bastion/VPN rather than broad internet exposure.</div>
