        <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;vertical-align:top;">
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin-bottom:6px;">At what layer does an AWS Network Load Balancer primarily operate?</div>
